<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Texaco cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Texaco cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney confirmed that it cut its rating on Texaco Inc to neutral from outperform on price.</p>
<p>-- Analyst James Falzey was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 5/8 to 94 in early Thursday trading.</p>
</text>
